@Sysco Food Service, a longtime advocate and supporter of Houston Food Bank, has donated over 600,000 lbs. of dry and refrigerated goods this past year. 

Thank you for helping us keep our pantries full and our neighbors fed. 🙏🍽️

Find a pantry near you: https://t.co/Ple6VUOcgB https://t.co/pXYARCUmal

We are honored to work alongside city leaders, including Mayor John Whitmire, Congresswoman Lizzie Fletcher, and Council Member Abbie Kamin to provide relief during this challenging time. 

@whitmire_john 
@RepFletcher 
@AbbieKamin

Happy Tuesday! I’m so grateful to  @adriennetrimble at @sysco for having @mamalavernefoods serve delicious treats at their booth at the @nmsdchq Conference &amp; Exchange. 

We both had to come and represent as Texas Fashionistas today with our FIRE FASHION ‘FITS! 🔥🙌🏽

